  "fullDescription": "250 Merry Christmas Coloring Pages For Adults: Volume – 2\n\n“Merry Christmas,” a delightful coloring book tailored exclusively for adults. Celebrate the holiday season in a unique and creative way as you immerse yourself in the intricate and heartwarming illustrations waiting for your personal touch.\n\nWithin the pages of “Merry Christmas,” you will find a collection of enchanting designs that capture the true essence of the season. From snowy landscapes and festive wreaths to ornate ornaments and cheerful Santa Claus scenes, this coloring book offers 190 pages of holiday magic that will warm your heart.\n\nVariety of Themes: Explore classic Christmas scenes, whimsical winter creatures, festive decorations, and much more. With 250 illustrations to choose from, you’ll find endless inspiration.\n\nHigh-resolution Merry Christmas Coloring Book page for your kdp interior, make your own unique interior for your book…\n\nYou Can Create 8 interiors With These 250 Merry Christmas Coloring Pages…\n\nYou will receive a .zip file containing all designs. These are in . PDF + PNG Format.( 300 Dpi Images )\n\nThis Interior Download Details:\n⭐️ Black And White Coloring Pages\n⭐️ 250 Merry Christmas Coloring Pages (300 dpi) (Ready to use)\n⭐️ Size A4 8.5×11″ inch\n⭐️ PDF file (Print ready)\n⭐️ 250 PNG Images file (300 dpi)\n⭐️ High-Quality 300 DPI Images File\n⭐️ All images is very good\nBook Cover Details:\n⭐️ 22 PNG file ( 300 dpi )\n⭐️ You can resize when you design\n\nNote: You can sell on it only Amazon kindle direct publishing.\nPerfect for your High content book business, fully tested in the Amazon Kindle Direct Publishing platform and ready to list!",
